I am trying to use N-mixture model to estimate abundance of Black-faced Ibis in Antisana Volcano in Ecuador. We conducted simultaneous survey with three visits in each site. I wonder if N-mixture model works without covariables. I do not find how to run this in pcount. I would appreciate any input on this subject.

All the best,

Adrian

