Dear Adrian,
Yes, you can fit a Nmixture model without covariates. You have to create an unmarked data frame for point count data without covariates. The model is then
model = pcount(~1 ~1, your UMF)
~1 means that you fit an intercept-only model.
Best wishes, Benedikt

