Subject: Inconsistent error messages when fitting models
Message-ID: <zWjNuhnImGk.Q3JftWrJAwAJ@unmarked.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/unmarked/c/zWjNuhnImGk/m/Q3JftWrJAwAJ>
